# p-drag-no-pan (h11-p-drag): a drag of P never pans the camera: the camera
# line before the drag and after it are equal (handle-drag-no-pan's shape).
# The drag is +150 px right in 5 px steps (30 steps, every one hits), held.
# Behaviour (read on ref-h11 at c6754e7, WebKit/Chromium/Firefox alike):
# cursor grab-active; the p line 5; the camera line unchanged.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 1028 290
wait 200
down
wait 150
move 1178 290 over 480
wait 300
shot p-drag-no-pan
up
